    <td align="right" valign="top" nowrap><b>Subject:</b></td>
    <td align="left" colspan="2" valign="top">type of gyro</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td align=right class=medium valign="top" nowrap><b>Question:</b></td>
    <td align=left class=medium valign="top" width="400" colspan="2">what is tied gyro and where is it used on aircraft?<br>
what is rate gyro and where is it used on aircraft?<br>
what is earth gyro and where is it used ?<br>
what is space gyro and where is it used ?<br>
</td>
